{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102300","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910230001:1":{"text":"어? 안쪽에 이렇게 커다란 동굴이 또 있었네...","source_cn":"咦？原来里面还有个这么大的洞窟呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B7803769D9958A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910230002:1":{"text":"끝이 보이지 않아... 안에는 뭐가 있을까? 혹시 보물이 있는 건 아닐까?","source_cn":"看不到尽头……里面会有什么呢？会不会有宝藏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A620AC1A3D56F03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910230003:1":{"text":"혹시 이 동굴 깊은 곳이, 아직 아무도 발견하지 못한 비밀 구역으로 이어져 있는 건 아닐까? 어쩌면...","source_cn":"这个海洞的深处会不会连通着从未被人发现的秘密区域？说不定……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5F2A67A3BDBFAB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910230004:1":{"text":"그만, 그만! 안쪽이 몬스터 소굴이면 어쩌려고?","source_cn":"停！里头万一是鱼怪的老巢怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142531F0B8CCC763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910230005:1":{"text":"바다에 고기 잡으러 나갈 땐 지켜야 할 규칙이 있어. 바로 “적당한 선에서 멈춰야 한다”는 거지. 배를 너무 멀리 몰고 나가면 다시는 못 돌아온다고!","source_cn":"出海打渔有个规矩——适可而止。船划得太远，就回不来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD640CF7DEB0C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1910230005":{"text":"바다에 고기 잡으러 나갈 땐 지켜야 할 규칙이 있어. 바로 “적당한 선에서 멈춰야 한다”는 거지. 배를 너무 멀리 몰고 나가면 다시는 못 돌아온다고!","source_cn":"出海打渔有个规矩——适可而止。船划得太远，就回不来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD640CF7DEB0C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910230006:1":{"text":"야, 덩치. 너 그거 무슨 뜻이야!","source_cn":"大个子，你啥意思！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA33887603E195E04","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"야, 덩치. 너 그거 무슨 뜻이야!","female":"야, 덩치. 너 그거 무슨 뜻이야!","variant_male_record_index":"254657","variant_female_record_index":"254658","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910230007:1":{"text":"난 원래 믿음직스럽거든!","source_cn":"咱一向很靠谱！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBC7F339B9E824C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 원래 믿음직스럽거든!","female":"난 원래 믿음직스럽거든!","variant_male_record_index":"254659","variant_female_record_index":"254660","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910230010:1":{"text":"알았어... 오늘은 확실히 너무 늦었네. 더 늦게 돌아가면 할머니가 걱정하실 거야.","source_cn":"好吧……今天的确太晚了，再不回去阿嬷要着急了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA34EFF85E36327","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910230011:1":{"text":"그래도 안에 뭐가 있는지 정말 궁금한데... 나중에 시간 나면 다시 탐험하러 오자.","source_cn":"不过，我还是很好奇里面有什么……我们有空再来这里探险吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EFEDA5BB59E2CFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"너 웬일로 믿음직스럽다?","source_cn":"难得看到你这么靠谱","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BEFEDD806B284D5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너 웬일로 믿음직스럽다?","female":"너 웬일로 믿음직스럽다?","variant_male_record_index":"95817","variant_female_record_index":"95818","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910230008:1":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6FCAFD420F69F57","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... ","female":"... ","variant_male_record_index":"276155","variant_female_record_index":"274683","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910230009:1":{"text":"톨란 감정 기복이 엄청 심하네! 분명 이렇게 말하고 싶을 거야. “내 말투 따라 하지 마!”","source_cn":"图澜的情绪波动得好厉害！我猜他一定想说……别学他说话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17ED742FDD083204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"완전 동의해!","source_cn":"咱同意你的说法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5FD489259E0A41A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"완전 동의해!","female":"완전 동의해!","variant_male_record_index":"95819","variant_female_record_index":"95820","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:2:3":{"text":"톨란 말이 맞아. 일단 타라사로 돌아가자","source_cn":"他说得对，我们先回塔拉萨吧","status":